                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A semisynthetic drug C₂₅H₃₈O₅ that decreases the level of cholesterol in the bloodstream and is derived from a compound produced by a mold (Aspergillus terreus)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
